#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/multitenancy.rst:2
msgid "Multitenancy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/multitenancy.rst:4
msgid ""
"A very common scenario for Managed Service Providers is the need to "
"provide access to VMware resources on a customer by customer basis. With "
"VMware several administrative features have been added to ensure customer"
" resources are properly scoped and isolated. For VMware it is possible to"
" assign specific `Networks`, `Datastores`, and `Resource Pools` to "
"customer accounts or even set the public visibility of certain resources,"
" therefore allowing all sub accounts access to the resource."
msgstr ""

